  "descriptionHtml": "<div class='product-description'>Sleek, quilted upper with embroidered Swoosh logoThick foam midsole with visible Nike Air cushioningHeel pull tabs for easy on and off accessibilityOval-shaped midsole adds 2000s aestheticClassic lace closure secures the fitRubber outsole for reliable traction across all surfacesThe Nike Air Max Portal is imported.These Women's Nike Air Max Portal Casual Shoes are a gateway to the golden days of the noughties. Crafted with a quilted upper that sports an embroidered swoosh and iconic visible Nike Air cushioning within its platform sole, this iteration of the Air Max reimagines retro style for a sleek, contemporary Swoosh silhouette.</div>\n\n<div class=\"product-specifications\" style=\"margin: 20px 0;\">\n  <h3 style=\"font-size: 16px; margin-bottom: 8px;\">Specifications</h3>\n  <table style=\"width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; font-size: 14px;\">\n    <tbody><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Brand</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Nike</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Model</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Women's Nike Air Max Portal Casual Shoes</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Gender</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Women's</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Sizing Category</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Adult</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Color</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Platinum Violet/Light Violet Ore/Sail/Violet Ore</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Manufacturer SKU</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>3495844</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Category</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Shoes</td></tr></tbody>\n  </table>\n</div>\n\n\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin: 20px 0; padding: 12px; border: 1px solid #e0e0e0; border-radius: 6px;\">\n  <summary style=\"font-weight: 600; cursor: pointer; font-siz